  "description": "The Sun Seeker Fat Tad CX is the most fun you'll have this low to the ground off road. This bad boy is equipped with front and rear suspension, chromoly frame and 4 inch wide off road tires! The Fat Tad will handle sand and gravel like no other trike out there. Other features include aluminum seat frame, padded seat and provisions to mount 4 water bottle cages.\nRear coil-over suspension and integrated front suspension\nAlloy rims, 55mm wide, 190mm rear hub with Q/R\nPromax mechanical disc brake system for front wheels\n20 x 4.0\" tires tuned for all trail conditions\nFull-range SRAM shifting with 3x8 gearing\nErgonomic chromoly handlbars\nAir-mesh seat with alloy seat frame\n10\" of trail-ready ground clearance\n(Boom modification may be required from 37\" - 40\")",
